POV: um terremoto 8.0 chega enquanto você está em casa com seu gato · credits

Everything visual is procedural (three.js code in this folder): the flat, furniture, you, the cat, the building, the city, the rain. No image assets, no real places, brands or people.
Safety advice on screen and in the voice: see FACTS.md (Ready.gov, American Red Cross, local emergency-management pet guidance). The quake itself is fiction.

